Name: CommonMark Java
Short Name: commonmark
URL: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/commonmark/commonmark/0.30.0/commonmark-0.30.0.jar
Version: 0.30.0
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: BSD-2-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes
CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Parses bounded assistant answer text into a CommonMark syntax tree for the
native Compose renderer. No HTML renderer or network image loader is used.
The artifact matches Maven Central byte for byte; the version is owned by
gradle/libs.versions.toml and used by both Gradle and GN.

Local Modifications:
None. GN excludes the Java module descriptor from the Android build.
-------------------- DEPENDENCY DIVIDER --------------------
Name: CommonMark Java GFM Tables
Short Name: commonmark-ext-gfm-tables
URL: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/commonmark/commonmark-ext-gfm-tables/0.30.0/commonmark-ext-gfm-tables-0.30.0.jar
Version: 0.30.0
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: BSD-2-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes
CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Parses GitHub Flavored Markdown tables into the same syntax tree. Its only
runtime dependency is CommonMark Java core above. Comparison tables are
rendered with native Compose components.

Local Modifications:
None. GN excludes the Java module descriptor from the Android build.
